                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "File: pupil.7z: contains all the preprocessed data for carrying out the pupil analysis.\n- PEEG_EEG*: subject-level timeseries\n- Folder: group_data: average timeseries\nFile: EEG.zip: contains all the preprocessed data for carrying out the EEG analysis. Note: file exceeds 20GB, therefore needs to be requested from the corresponding author B.L.\n- P0XX.mat: the epoched and cleaned time-domain data\n- P0XX_fft.mat: the downsampled frequency-domain data\nNote: the other preprocessed data files, including Gender, blink rate and no artefact selected subject, are available here: https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/Additional_files/23514255"
